    "detailed_description": "<h1>NEW GAME! Coming soon...</h1><p></p><br><h1>DLC\u6346\u7ed1\u5305\u73b0\u5df2\u4e0a\u7ebf\uff01</h1><p>\u5305\u542b\u300a\u6a31\u8272\u96f6\u843d&amp;\u666f\u8272\u8427\u7136\u300b\u548c\u300a\u548c\u5e73\u9ed8\u793a\u5f55\u300b\u7684DLC \u6346\u7ed1\u5305\u73b0\u5df2\u4e0a\u7ebf\uff01\u516b\u6298\u9500\u552e\uff01\u70b9\u8fdbDLC\u5546\u5e97\u9875\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u901a\u8fc7\u6b64\u94fe\u63a5\u8d2d\u4e70\uff1a</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 An encounter in Tokuo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 that nothing about love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/554d616b972b97311b3b8c4217794c17.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Visual Novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/67ef9c903aaaba022180ea2087e32a47.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>\u3000\u3000It is the year 1988. Japan is in the midst of the bubble economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000New buildings are sprouting up everywhere, and the people are ecstatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000The old disappears and the new is born,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000but there are some people, some places, some things, that nobody notices...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000or perhaps nobody chooses to notice them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000This is a story of people who live for one year...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000in such a little corner of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/6f7a723abc488643834154f5f14dfba8.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>\u3000\u3000Kanna is a first-year high school student</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000who's involved in a traffic accident during the summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000She finds herself unable to stay in her hometown any longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Jing fails his university entrance exams in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000He spends a year or so working at a job he doesn't like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Both of them hear of the incredible opportunities presenting themselves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000in the bubble economy of Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Therefore, Kanna drops out of high school and goes to Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Jing quits his job and goes to Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000The job both of them set their eyes on,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000would have them simply living in an old, run-down train station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Although the job only pays a measly 400 yen per hour, it runs for 24 hours a day,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000so it really isn't that bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000They wouldn't have to pay rent, heating, or electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Kanna is a bit awkward around people, and Jing doesn't speak Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000The employer only wants one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000Neither wants to give up on this job, so Sakura, the woman in charge of hiring them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000recommends that they simply do it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/295c8eb6a00619370221abd7b2e9a87e.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/b04206a9156660503342946a7c428405.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age 19 \u2192 20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I have a goal.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He failed his university entrance exams in China and went to Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What surprises him the most during his time there is the cost of living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day of part-time work in Japan earns more than a month of salaried work in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/75bbbc358d732e8637228dcb3815c2a1.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age 15 \u2192 16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I was unlucky... That's what I decided to think.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She dropped out of high school and moved to Tokyo because of the bubble economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's a little introverted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She enjoys eating sunflower seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height 159cm, Measurements 81/62/87</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/ff94030a2f263d675082fbace6204faa.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age 7 \u2192 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Sis, buy me ice cream! Ice cream!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She follows her sister to the big city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's bubbly and upbeat, but never afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's still a child, so she doesn't really understand what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height 128cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/8717629d31929da9baae343c351c8622.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age 21 \u2192 22</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Many people still have a lot to deal with. Like you and me.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She grew up in Tokyo. Her family is involved in the real estate business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She employs both main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's nice and approachable, but she can put her foot down when needs be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height 165cm, Measurements 89/60/90</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/639d25e24c53750c3f9e369ce6bd6d48.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age 37 \u2192 38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I don't do stuff that doesn't earn money.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He came to Japan twenty years earlier from China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For various reasons, he keeps trying to push dangerous jobs on Jing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most of his business is in nightclubs and land speculation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/8f6af0ebb300faefa178ae96af44bad9.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div>Age ???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A black cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He lives in the old station building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He seems friendly, but runs away if you try to catch him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/45ee0304a2987b41d16166821aba89a8.avif?t=1735696022\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Original Story \u00b7 Scenario: </strong>Tomo Kataoka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Concept Art: </strong>Werkbau</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Character Art: </strong>Werkbau, Ringo, Takehiko Akino, Yatumi Suzuame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Scene Art: </strong>Ringo, forfreedo, Kyarumii</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Cast: </strong>M.N.H, Hiroko Taguchi, Kaori Nazuka, Yuko Goto, Jin Li, Tomoe Tamiyasu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Music: </strong>bermei.inazawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>OP Vocal: </strong>Annabel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>BGM Vocal \u00b7 Chorus: </strong>lasah, Raheem &quot;Mega Ran&quot; Jarbo, Mari Yura, Annabel, Shouichi Taguchi, Mashiro Shirakami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>LOGO Design: </strong>Nachi Kio (KOME WORKS)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>UI Design: </strong>Mu Xia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Visual Design: </strong>C.I.C, Mu Xia\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Movie: </strong>C.I.C, Yazi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Performance \u00b7 Script: </strong>2B, Koraku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Program: </strong>Xiao Ai 363</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Operation \u00b7 PR: </strong>Xue Han</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Web Design: </strong>Yume Amamiya, Shi Jiu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Planner \u00b7 Director \u00b7 Producer: </strong>Koraku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3000\u3000English Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Translation: </strong>Holm Hinners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Editing: </strong>tyabann</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Script Insertion: </strong>Alice Davidson</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Image Editing: </strong>Liew Shan Yuan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Quality Assurance: </strong>R. Stuart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Project Manager: </strong>John Baumlin, PMP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>General Manager: </strong>Koji Hotta</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000<strong>Beta Testers: </strong>Dizzy Valiel, arccun, Cassandra Hockaday</p>",
